 * @since 1.0
 * @todo Add audio graph and bus layout docs.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup UISystem UI System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Placeholder for UI frameworks, widgets, and layout.
 * @since 1.0
 * @todo Document UI layer once components are defined.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup SaveLoadSystem Save/Load System
 * @ingroup InterstellarDocs
 * @brief Placeholder for game state persistence and serialization.
